      <section class="section-insight for-whom">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1408 horizontal w-container">
          <div class="column-wrapper">
            <div class="top_side-slider-2 left center-sm">
              <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                <div class="text-12-caps-2 opacity-60">WHAT WE LEARNED</div>
                <div class="max-w-380-slider full">
                  <h2 class="h2 text-wrap-balance"><span class="span-pink-2">Most SaaS buyers decide </span>before they ever speak to you</h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150-3 opacity-80">This is exactly why the video on your site, and the one inside your trial, has to work harder than it used to.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-vflex list-wrap">
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---01.avif" alt="A purple circle with a play button on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">Buyers complete roughly 70% of their evaluation before contacting a vendor, and 81% have already chosen their shortlist before sales even enters the picture (6sense 2025 B2B Buyer Experience Report).</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---02.avif" alt="A purple button with a blue envelope on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">67% of B2B buyers say they&#x27;d prefer to buy without talking to a salesperson at all (Gartner, cited in 2026 SaaS sales research).</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---03.avif" alt="A purple button with a speaker inside of it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">Self-serve free trials convert at just 4.6% on average, compared with 17.4% for signups that get some human guidance along the way, which is exactly the gap a strong self-serve video is built to close (ChartMogul and ICONIQ Capital, 2026).</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---04.avif" alt="A purple button with a shopping cart on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">Across the SaaS industry, the median activation rate, meaning the share of new signups who actually reach real product value, sits at just 38% (2026 SaaS PLG benchmark data).</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="column-wrapper hide-small"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67601fee10470581a90722d7/67602bd27d29b464069f8f7a_Key%20Insight.png" alt=""></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section-purpose for-whom">
        <div class="line-gradient-2"></div><img sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Frame-1707478540_2Frame-1707478540.avif 500w, /images/Frame-1707478540_2.avif 2401w" alt="" src="/images/Frame-1707478540_2.avif" loading="lazy" class="image-purpose-3">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1408 w-container">
          <div class="slider-wrapper-4">
            <div class="top_side-slider-2">
              <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                <div class="text-12-caps-2 opacity-60">Why is works</div>
                <div class="max-w-380-slider full">
                  <h2 class="h2"><span class="span-pink-2">Why SaaS product videos</span><br>are essential</h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150-5 opacity-80">A good SaaS explainer video does four things well.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-list-wrap-2">
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Why-AI-Icon---01.avif" alt="A white circle with blue squares in it" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Simplified</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Turns complex SaaS features into something anyone can understand in a few seconds.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Why-AI-Icon---02.avif" alt="An icon of a book with a star on it" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Demonstrate</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Shows your product actually working, not just a list of what it can do.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Why-AI-Icon---03.avif" alt="A purple star in a white circle" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Highlight</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Shows people what makes your product different from every other tool that looks like it.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
