                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">It&#x27;s a short video that explains what your SaaS product does and why it matters, usually somewhere between 60 and 120 seconds, built to take a first time viewer from not understanding your product to wanting to try it. Most SaaS companies use one on their homepage, though the strongest ones also show up inside onboarding and in sales conversations.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14a7" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How do you make a SaaS explainer video?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14ab" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We start with your actual product rather than a script written in isolation, work out the two or three moments that matter most to a first time viewer, then build the visuals and voiceover around those. Most projects run from discovery to delivery in under two weeks, depending on complexity.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b0" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Our product does a lot. How do you decide what to actually show in the video?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b4" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We usually start by asking what makes someone go from curious to actually trying your product. That&#x27;s normally two or three moments, not the full feature list, and we build the video around those.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b9" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Can this video work both on our landing page and inside our onboarding flow?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14bd" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Often yes, though the two usually need slightly different cuts. A landing page video has to earn attention from someone who doesn&#x27;t know you yet. An onboarding video already has an engaged user, so it can move faster and go deeper. We can scope both from the same project if that&#x27;s useful.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14c2" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Our UI changes all the time. Won&#x27;t the video be out of date in a few months?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14c6" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We build most SaaS videos with this in mind. Interface elements are usually built as separate, swappable pieces, so if a screen or a button changes, we can update just that part instead of re-animating the whole video.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14cb" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">We&#x27;re pre-revenue and don&#x27;t have many paying customers yet. Can you still make a strong video?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14cf" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes. Plenty of the SaaS companies we work with are early stage. We&#x27;ll usually rely more on showing the product itself doing the job well, since that matters a lot even without a long list of customer logos yet.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="237b7cfb-96e6-8769-f68d-ac2269a2d687" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Do you only make one big video, or can we get a library of shorter content too?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="237b7cfb-96e6-8769-f68d-ac2269a2d68b" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Most SaaS clients end up needing both. A single explainer often grows into a small library over time, feature announcements, onboarding clips, social cuts, once the first video proves useful. Mirakl is a good example, one explainer turned into eight projects over seven months.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="2d846315-32dc-4ab7-f973-0467c52bd3ab" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What if we need changes after the video is delivered?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="2d846315-32dc-4ab7-f973-0467c52bd3af" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We work with you until it&#x27;s right. If something needs adjusting after delivery, tell us what&#x27;s off and we&#x27;ll work through the changes with you rather than pointing at a revision policy.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="b5fc50f7-6ac8-b5cf-2a61-ee36599db5c3" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Can we use the video across different platforms?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="b5fc50f7-6ac8-b5cf-2a61-ee36599db5c7" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes. We deliver your final video in the formats each channel needs, so the same project works on your website, social channels, and anywhere else you plan to use it.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="0f03b243-c4f6-5887-138b-6ff1332668bb" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What&#x27;s the pricing structure, and how do I get started?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="0f03b243-c4f6-5887-138b-6ff1332668bf" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav style="height:0px" class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We offer a fixed price per video with a clear quote upfront, or a monthly subscription if you&#x27;re likely to need ongoing content. Book a call or request a free sample and we&#x27;ll ask a few questions about your product before quoting.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
